11	/**
12	 * Rejects a create request once the maximum number of owners (100) have already been created for a
13	 * given business day, counted by registration date, so no more than 100 owners are registered per
14	 * business day. The day counted is this request's effective registration date rolled onto a
15	 * business day (see {@link BusinessDays}): the date supplied in the body, or the server date when
16	 * none was supplied, with a weekend rolled forward to Monday. Runs before {@link BuildOwner}; a day
17	 * already at its limit is a 429 via {@link TooManyOwnersTodayException}.
